## Local Configuration Template for MHS Player
#
# Copy this file to 'local.properties' and adjust the SDK path below to match your machine setup.
# Do NOT check your customized 'local.properties' into version control.

# Location of the Android SDK (adjust for Windows, macOS, or Linux)
# On Windows, escape backslashes: C\:\\Users\\YourUsername\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YOUR_USERNAME\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
